---
import FAQitem from "./FAQitem.astro";
---

<div class="card">
    <div class="cardHeader">
        <span class="cardTitle">FAQ</span>
    </div>
    <div class="tableFlex">
        <FAQitem>
            <span slot="q"
                >What is <i>HoloPro Fans PH?</i> What is <i>PH Starlights?</i
                ></span
            >
            HoloPro Fans PH is a fan organization that produces hololive & HOLOSTARS
            fan projects and events in the Philippines, both online and offline. HoloPro
            Fans PH has also been responsible for the 2024 and 2025 HoloFlasta Projects.
            PH Starlights is an unoffcial fan group dedicated to supporting HOLOSTARS,
            UPROAR!!, and HOLOSTARS English as a whole. Both HoloPro Fans PH and PH
            Starlights are collaborating on the 2026 HoloFlasta Project while abiding
            by COVER Corp.'s Fan Support Advertising Guidelines.
        </FAQitem>
        <FAQitem>
            <span slot="q"> How can I support <i>HoloFlasta Project?</i></span>
            You can send your donations at flasta.holoprofansph.org via our official
            Ko-fi under <a href="#" onclick="showDialog()"
                >ko-fi.com/phstarlights0603</a
            >. For fans residing in the Philippines, you can donate locally via
            InstaPay QR (GCash, Maya, GoTyme) or Pixel (for cards and others).
        </FAQitem>
        <FAQitem
            q="What happens if the goal is not reached?"
            a="The organizers may seek compromises to the original goal of the project to fit the final donation amount."
        />
        <FAQitem
            q="What happens if the amount has exceeded the goal?"
            a="The extra amount may be donated to either the volunteer artists or to a chosen charity."
        />
        <FAQitem q="Will there be physical events during the campaign?">
            Should the campaign be successful, the flower stands will be
            available for viewing to the public as it will be positioned outside
            of the halls inside SMX Convention Center. Fans are welcome to visit
            the area and share their experiences with the hashtag <b
                >#HoloFlastaPH2026💐</b
            >. We may also plan to do a standee auction at the end of Cosplay
            Mania 2026. Any announcements regarding gatherings or meet-ups will
            be posted on the official HoloPro Fans PH and PH Starlights Twitter
            (X) and Facebook social media accounts.
        </FAQitem>
    </div>
</div>
